Dear brothers in arms, 

Thank you for your positive feedback and sometimes critical reviews. We are carefully listening and are working our socks off to improve our game and make it better. We are glad to announce the newest release v1.03 that contains bug fixes, general game improvements and also the most commonly requested features: 


Cursor shows metadata regarding level of protection of cover;
Fixed bug with absence of metadata regarding possibility to shoot through fences;
Improved logic of random generator at start camp;
Improved displaying of visibility zones;
Added GUI buttons of camera zoom;
AI improvement;
Improved balance of mortars and grenades;  
Improved levels - 2, 3, 7 and 14; 
Improved tutorial;
Fixed small bugs and typos;


See you at the battlefields, 

Bretwalda Games

